          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Test Booking</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Book a test appointment on your phone. Verify confirmation email, calendar entry, and reminder work correctly. Cancel the test afterward.</p>
