        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Two Sample Contacts</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Create one with verified attendance, one without. Check full event and post-event journeys in a safe test setup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Verify Each Step</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Registration → confirmation → reminders → attendance tagging → correct follow-up → booking link → appointment confirmation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">No Cross-Contamination</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Ensure attended and no-show contacts receive only their intended messages. No duplicates, no wrong paths.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Measure and Reuse -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-teal-100">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Measure and Reuse</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-3">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Four Key Numbers</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Registrations, actual attendees, replies/qualified conversations, and appointments booked. Also measure opt-outs and delivery problems.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Duplicate for Next Time</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Duplicate the event and adapt time, joining link, copy, tag names, and event filters. Never assume cloned workflows update every reference automatically.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Update Everything</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Manually verify all references in duplicated workflows. Tag names, event filters, and calendar links must be updated for the new event.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Point -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-amber-400">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">Key Point</h3>
        <p class="text-amber-800 text-lg">A system that has not been end-to-end tested is a system that will fail. Create two sample contacts, walk through every step, verify correct messages, book a test appointment, and measure real numbers. Then duplicate, update all references, and run the next event with confidence.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Action Steps -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-emerald-200">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900">Action Steps — Module 24: Advanced Event Marketing</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Add Booking Link</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Put a tested calendar booking URL in both attended and no-show follow-up emails.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Run End-to-End Test</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Create two sample contacts. Verify registration, confirmation, reminders, attendance tagging, correct follow-up, and booking all work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Record Metrics</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Count registrations, attendees, replies, and bookings. Note opt-outs and delivery issues.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">4</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Prepare for Reuse</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Duplicate the event, update all references, and verify the new workflow targets the correct event before going live.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>',
      title = 'Book Conversations, Test, and Reuse',
      lesson_number = 8,
      sort_order = 8,
      updated_at = NOW()
    WHERE id = v_lesson_id;
    
    RAISE NOTICE 'Updated lesson: Book Conversations, Test, and Reuse';
  END IF;

END $$;


-- Insert Quiz Questions for Lesson: Book Conversations, Test, and Reuse

DO $$
DECLARE
  v_module_id UUID;
  v_lesson_id UUID;
  v_quiz_id UUID;
BEGIN
  -- Get Module by week number
  SELECT id INTO v_module_id FROM public.training_modules WHERE week_number = 23 LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_module_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Module 23 not found';
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  -- Get the lesson ID
  SELECT id INTO v_lesson_id 
  FROM public.lessons 
  WHERE slug = 'm23-book-conversations-test-reuse' AND module_id = v_module_id;
  
  IF v_lesson_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Lesson m23-book-conversations-test-reuse not found in module 23';
    RETURN;
  END IF;
  
  -- Delete existing quizzes to avoid duplicates
  DELETE FROM public.lesson_quizzes WHERE lesson_id = v_lesson_id;


  -- Question 1
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What four numbers should you measure after an event?', 
    '["Social media likes, shares, comments, and followers","Email opens, click rates, bounce rates, and unsubscribes","Website traffic, page views, time on site, and conversion rate","Registrations, attendees, replies/qualified conversations, and appointments booked"]'::jsonb,
    'Registrations, attendees, replies/qualified conversations, and appointments booked',
    'The four key numbers are registrations, actual attendees, replies/qualified conversations, and appointments booked. These measure whether your event system produces actual business outcomes, not just activity.', 
    1
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 2
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What should you do when duplicating an event for reuse?', 
    '["Delete the old event before duplicating","Manually update time, link, copy, tag names, and event filters","Assume all references update automatically","Keep everything the same and just change the date"]'::jsonb,
    'Manually update time, link, copy, tag names, and event filters',
    'Never assume cloned workflows update every reference automatically. Manually verify and update tag names, event filters, calendar links, and all references for the new event.', 
    2
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 3
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'How many sample contacts should you create for testing?', 
    '["None — testing is not necessary for simple events","One is enough for basic testing","Two: one with verified attendance, one without","At least ten to get statistical significance"]'::jsonb,
    'Two: one with verified attendance, one without',
    'Create two sample contacts: one with verified attendance and one without. This lets you test both the attended and no-show paths to ensure each receives the correct messages.', 
    3
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;

END $$;
